  unitName: "Mard Geer (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 860547
  unitNumber: 8336
  description: Crafty yet arrogant, Mard Geer is best known as the member of the
    dark guild Tartaros. He often refers to himself in the third person and is known
    to look down on humans. The Tartaros' Guild Master, E.N.D. is sealed on the book
    that he always carry with him anywhere.
  summonDesc: It shall begin soon... Darkness will pour forth and swallow the light
    of the world!
  fusionDesc: It pains Mard Geer to think of his subordinates playing around with
    creatures lower than insects.
